cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use Ventris in your research, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: Ventris
abstract: >-
  Ventris opens EEG recordings saved as EDF or CSV in the browser to explore
  their signals, annotations and frequency bands. It can also open public
  recordings from OpenNeuro by link. Everything runs in the browser, so
  local recordings never leave the computer.
authors:
  - given-names: Bhargav
    family-names: Kowshik
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-11-14
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: https://github.com/ventris-tools/ventris
url: https://ventris-tools.github.io/ventris/
keywords:
  - EEG
  - EDF
  - CSV
  - neuroscience
  - signal processing
